#. i18n: file: coverage/reportwidget.ui:45
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QPushButton, startButton)
#: rc.cpp:19
msgid "Start coverage analysis"
msgstr "Iniciar a análise de cobertura"

#. i18n: file: coverage/reportwidget.ui:50
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QPushButton, startButton)
#: rc.cpp:22
msgid ""
"Start coverage analysis in the specified path.\n"
"\n"
"The directory and, recursively, its subdirectories are scanned for .gcda "
"files."
msgstr ""
"Inicia a análise de cobertura na rota especificada.\n"
"\n"
"Examinaranse recursivamente o directorio e os seus subdirectorios á "
"procura de ficheiros .gcda."

#. i18n: file: coverage/reportwidget.ui:87
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (KLineEdit, filterBox)
#: rc.cpp:27
msgid "Filter directories by name"
msgstr "Filtrar os directorios segundo o nome"

#. i18n: file: coverage/reportwidget.ui:92
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KLineEdit, filterBox)
#: rc.cpp:30
msgid ""
"When the report is in directory mode, only those containing the specified "
"text in their path are shown.\n"
"\n"
"In file mode, the filter has no effect."
msgstr ""
"Cando se informa no modo directorio, só se mostran os que conteñen na rota o "
"texto que se especifique.\n"
"\n"
"No modo ficheiro, este filtro non ten efeito nengún."

