#: rc.cpp:47 rc.cpp:55
msgid ""
"Number of covered lines in the selected directories.\n"
"\n"
"Covered lines are those that were executed at least once."
msgstr ""
"O número de liñas cubertas nos directorios escollidos.\n"
"\n"
"As liñas cubertas son as que foron executadas polo menos unha vez."

#. i18n: file: coverage/reportwidget.ui:141
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, nrofCoveredLinesTextLabel)
#: rc.cpp:52
msgid "Covered Lines:"
msgstr "Liñas cubertas:"

#. i18n: file: coverage/reportwidget.ui:162
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QLabel, slocTextLabel)
#. i18n: file: coverage/reportwidget.ui:174
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QLabel, sloc)
#: rc.cpp:63 rc.cpp:71
msgid ""
"Total number of lines of code in the selected directories.\n"
"\n"
"Note that it only includes executable lines. That is, things like comments, "
"macros, forward declarations... aren't taken into account."
msgstr ""
"O número total de liñas de código nos directorios escollidos.\n"
"\n"
"Lembre que só inclúe as liñas executábeis. As outras, como comentarios, "
"macros, declaracións antecipadas, non son contabilizadas."

#. i18n: file: coverage/reportwidget.ui:165
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, slocTextLabel)
#: rc.cpp:68
msgid "Total SLOC:"
msgstr "SLOC total:"

#. i18n: file: coverage/reportwidget.ui:225
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (Veritas::DrillDownView, table)
#: rc.cpp:79
msgid ""
"Coverage report.\n"
"\n"
"In directory mode, the report summarizes the coverage with a list of all the "
"directories that contain at least one covered file. It could include "
"directories out of the specified path, depending on the files included in "
"the source code.\n"
"\n"
"In file mode, all the files of the selected directory are shown. If several "
"directories are selected, only the files of the last selected directory are "
"shown. Double clicking on any of the items shows the associated file in the "
"editor, annotated with the coverage information.\n"
"\n"
"You can change between directory and file mode using left and right keys."
msgstr ""
"Informe de cobertura.\n"
"\n"
"No modo directorio o informe resume a cobertura cunha listaxe de directorios "
"que conteñen polo menos un ficheiro cuberto. Pode incluir directorios que fiquen "
"fora da rota especificada, dependendo dos ficheiros incluidos no código fonte.\n"
"\n"
"No modo ficheiro móstranse todos os ficheiros do directorio escollido. De "
"escoller varios só se mostrarán os do último que escollese. Se fai duplo-click "
"en calquera dos ítens mostrará no editor o ficheiro asociado, anotado coa "
"información da cobertura.\n"
"\n"
"Pode trocar entre os modos de directorio e ficheiro cos cursores dereito e "
"esquerdo."

